      "name": "exact-run-results",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "classification": "safe-wrapper",
      "rationale": "Queueing now allocates a monotonic run identity and snapshots the exact selected tests. Safe RunReport construction copies bounded UTF-8 identities, validates terminal statuses, maps native Unknown to NotRun, and finishes only the matching active run, so historical engine totals cannot satisfy current-run validation.",
      "items": [
